  "details": "After the cache has been cleared, or after reloading into a instance after a de-sync, entering a instance requires a fresh download of everyone. For fbt users this means their avatar is halfway through the ground while they load themselves, and it can take several minutes for their avatar to load. I personally always see my avatar load near the end of the loading cue. It’s also makes it difficult to change avatars, especially after a de-sync where you are stuck as the default robot.",
